   "title": "Asian stocks rally after Wall Street rebound as Jensen Huang returns as Nvidia's CEO",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/world/20261124/asian-stocks-rally-after-wall-street-rebound-as-jensen-huang-returns-as-nvidias-ceo",
