   "title": "Discover Seoul Pass tops 400,000 sales in 1st decade",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/lifestyle/travel-food/20261124/discover-seoul-pass-tops-400000-sales-in-1st-decade",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
