   "title": "SME exports account for 23.9% of Korea's shipments in January-October",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/economy/others/20261124/sme-exports-account-for-239-of-koreas-shipments-in-january-october",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
