   "title": "Air Force deploys early warning, forecast system for space weather observation",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/southkorea/defense/20261124/air-force-deploys-early-warning-forecast-system-for-space-weather-observation",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
